# P4: Follow chord on Tracker+ and Mini. Pattern screen, page 3 (F8 twice): F4 is the follow mode of the track under the cursor, F5 its chord track.
# F4 four times steps the mode Off -> Snap -> Transp -> Tr+Snap -> Off (P8: the flow ends on that mode trace).
title: Follow chord on Tracker+ (P4)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap Pattern
wait 800ms
tap F8
wait 400ms
tap F8
wait 800ms
expect text "Follow"
shot follow-off
tap F4
wait 600ms
shot follow-snap
tap F4
wait 600ms
shot follow-transp
expect text "Chord"
tap F4
wait 600ms
tap F4
wait 600ms
shot follow-off-again
# ends on the poke read (plus_flows.sh poke_ok, UISHOT_TRACE_FOLLOW): the cursor track went Snap, Transp, Tr+Snap, Off
